ed with Hellfire rounds) may be fired every turn, Flamer  may be fired once. Cannot fire both in same turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Pg" typeId="mh6-506723232344415441232323" /></characteristics></profile><profile id="fb1f6c9a-5446-7579-7255-317e7b4f5037-6e9c41a" name="Infrared Targeting" hidden="false" typeId="mh6-57617267656172204974656d23232344415441232323" typeName="Wargear Item" page="6"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="mh6-4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">Night Vision</characteristic><characteristic name="Pg" typeId="mh6-506723232344415441232323" /></characteristics></profile><profile id="80e137d5-486d-1eb9-819e-496c5537dcbe-6e9c41a" name="Initiate" hidden="false" typeId="mh6-556e697423232344415441232323" typeName="Unit" page="119"><characteristics><characteristic name="Unit Type" typeId="mh6-556e6974205479706523232344415441232323">Infantry</characteristic><characteristic name="WS" typeId="mh6-575323232344415441232323">4</characteristic><characteristic name="BS" typeId="mh6-425323232344415441232323">4</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="mh6-5323232344415441232323">4</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="mh6-5423232344415441232323">4</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="mh6-5723232344415441232323">1</characteristic><characteristic name="I" typeId="mh6-4923232344415441232323">4</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="mh6-4123232344415441232323">1</characteristic><characteristic name="LD" typeId="mh6-4c4423232344415441232323">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="mh6-5361766523232344415441232323">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Pg" typeId="mh6-506723232344415441232323">119</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="1d66ad61-0432-80fc-c768-04202aa4a257-6e9c41a" name="Iron Halo" hidden="false" typeId="mh6-57617267656172204974656d23232344415441232323" typeName="Wargear Item" page="124"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="mh6-4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">4+ Invul Sv</characteristic><characteristic name="Pg" typeId="mh6-506723232344415441232323" /></characteristics></profile><profile id="11d20299-e7f9-3570-fa14-d826d867ef3d-6e9c41a" name="Ironclad Assault Launchers" hidden="false" typeId="mh6-57617267656172204974656d23232344415441232323" typeName="Wargear Item" page="126"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="mh6-4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">A model with ironclad assault launchers does not suffer the penalty to its Initiative for charging enemies through difficult terrain. Furthermore, enemies charging a model with ironclad assault launchers do not gain bonus Attacks from charging unless the model was already locked in combat from a previous turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Pg" typeId="mh6-506723232344415441232323" /></characteristics></profile><profile id="d5307da8-dc99-0fb3-cbae-7c7796f2a41e-6e9c41a" name="Ironclad Dreadnought" hidden="false" typeId="mh6-57616c6b657223232344415441232323" typeName="Walker" page="91"><characteristics><characteristic name="WS" typeId="mh6-575323232344415441232323">4</characteristic><characteristic name="BS" typeId="mh6-425323232344415441232323">4</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="mh6-5323232344415441232323">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Front" typeId="mh6-46726f6e7423232344415441232323">13</characteristic><characteristic name="Side" typeId="mh6-5369646523232344415441232323">13</characteristic><characteristic name="Rear" typeId="mh6-5265617223232344415441232323">10</characteristic><characteristic name="I" typeId="mh6-4923232344415441232323">4</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="mh6-4123232344415441232323">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Type" typeId="mh6-5479706523232344415441232323">Walker</characteristic><characteristic name="Pg" typeId="mh6-506723232344415441232323">91</characteristic><characteristic name="HP" typeId="mh6-485023232