      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A model with ironclad assault launchers does not suffer the penalty to its Initiative for charging enemies through difficult terrain. Furthermore, enemies charging a model with ironclad assault launchers do not gain bonus Attacks from charging unless the model was already locked in combat from a previous turn.</characteristic>
