      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">2+ Armour Sv, 5+ Invul Sv, Relentless, cannot perform a Sweeping Advance or pursue a more lightly armoured foe when they flee (this affects both Terminators &amp; any unit they join). Count as 2 models for transport purposes, cannot embark a Rhino or Razorback.</characteristic>
