      <description>At the start of the shooting phase, choose a unit within 12" with the same faction as the Excelsior. This unit gains one of the following USR until the start of your next turn: Counter-Attack, Fearless, Hit &amp; Run, Interceptor, Preferred Enemy, Sky Fire, Split Fire or Tank Hunter.</description>
