  <rule id="efb52a05-643d-66c4-91b9-2d41104f4f54-ce98a" name="* Friendly Games Only" hidden="false" page="0">
      <description>These Characters are not part of the Tyrant's Legion Army List. However, they are included here due to their participation in the Badab War, where they fought for the secessionist cause.
As such &amp; with the consent of your opponents, they may add colour to friendly games, but should not be chosen for competitive or tournament play.</description>
