      <rules>
        <rule id="16c7-58d7-5251-8186-02c2e" name="Master of the Hunt" publicationId="7ab0-ceb9-pubN65751" hidden="false">
          <description>If Kor'sarro Khan is your Warlord, friendly White Scars models that have the Bike unit type, or are embarked on a Rhino or Razorback, have the Scout special rule.  In addition, if Kor'sarro Khan slays the enemy Warlord in a challenge, you immediately score D3 extra Victory Points</description>
        </rule>
