      <rules>
        <rule id="ae31-f6c9-e04b-ee9e-02c2e" name="Repair" publicationId="7ab0-ceb9-pubN65751" hidden="false">
          <description>If a Rhino is Immobilised, then in subsequent turns, it may attempt to repair itself instead of shooting.  To make the attempt, roll a D6 in the Shooting phase; on a roll of a 6+, the vehicle is no longer Immobilised.  Note that a successful Repair does not restore a Hull Point.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
