                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Heavy 1, Large Blast, Armourbane, Concussive, Collapsing Singularity</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule id="23fe-aea2-bd98-dfed-02c2e" name="Collapsing Singularity" publicationId="7ab0-ceb9-pubN174565" hidden="false">
              <description>Before firing the weapon, roll a D6. On a result of a 1, the firing Knight-Atrapos suffers a single Hull Point of damage with no saves of any kind before the attack is carried out. On a result of a 6, the attack is carried out with the Vortex special rule.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
