                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A model with the Occular Augmetics upgrade can re-roll results of 1 on both the vehicle damage table and Destroyer Weapon attack table when shooting at a target under 12" with a ranged weapon. Occular Augmetics also grants the model the Night Vision special rule.</characteristic>
