              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This provides a 3+ Invulnerable save. However, should this save be failed and Narvaez survives, roll a further D6. On a 4+, the Actinic Halo continues to work, otherwise it cannot be used for the rest of the game.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
