              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This grants Armenneus Valthex the Counter-attack special rule, a 5+ Invulnerable save, and provides Valthex with two Dendrite blades. Note that the extra attack this provides is already incorporated into his profile:</characteristic>
