          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per game, one of the vehicles weapons gains the Skyfire, Interceptor, Tank Hunters and Night Vision special rules. The use of this rule should be declared before any to</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
