            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The wearer of the Helm of Censure has the Preferred Enemy special rule.  Against Chaos Space Marines he re-rolls all failed To Hit and To Wound rolls.</characteristic>
