              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A model can fire its grenade harness in addition to another weapon.  In addition, models in the wearer's unit do not suffer the penalty to their initiative for charging enemies through difficult terrain, but fight at their normal initiative in the ensuing combat.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
