              <conditions>
                <condition childId="6c91-d214-036a-50a2" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="notInstanceOf" value="1" />
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <rules>
            <rule name="White Scars Chapter Banner" id="95b2-b844-ed11-ab2d" hidden="false">
              <description>This Holy Relic can be revealed in each and every White Scars' Movement Phase during which the bearer has moved and is no longer in a vehicle. Any unit of White Scares infantry or bikes that have at least one model within 6" of the bearer when it is revealed may move an extra D6" rather than firing in the following Shooting phase.
Add +1 to the Space Marine combat resolution socre of any assault that takes place within 6" of the Sacred Banner. However, if the model bearing the standard is slain in close combat, then the enemy model that slew him captures the standard gains the +1 bonus to combat resolution from then on. It is possible for the model to change hands multiple times per game.</description>
              <modifiers>
                <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="8f0b-3e54-c10f-0a71" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="ancestor" shared="true" type="notInstanceOf" value="0" />
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
