          <rules>
            <rule name="Krak Grenades" id="722c-bf15-ebf6-f791" hidden="false">
              <description>In close combat Tyrannic War Veterans can choose to use krak grenades as close combat weapons. Regardless of the number of attacks on a model's profile and modifiers for charging or having two weapons, each model may only make one attack with a krak grenade, hitting on a 6+ normally, or 3+ if against a Preferred Enemy. Any hits are resolved at Strength 6, ignoring Armour Saves.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </entryLink>
